<titlePage type="main"><docTitle><titlePart type="main"><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Einen Jux<lb/>
will er &#x017F;ich machen</hi>.</hi></titlePart><lb/>
<titlePart type="sub">Po&#x017F;&#x017F;e mit Ge&#x017F;ang in vier Aufzu&#x0364;gen,</titlePart><lb/>
</docTitle> <byline><hi rendition="#g">von</hi><lb/>
<docAuthor><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Johann Ne&#x017F;troy</hi>.</hi></docAuthor></byline><lb/>
<titlePart type="desc">Mu&#x017F;ik von Herrn Kapellmei&#x017F;ter Adolph Mu&#x0364;ller.</titlePart><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
