<pb n="57" facs="#f0063"/>
<sp who="#SON"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Sonders</hi></speaker> <stage>(betroffen).</stage><lb/>
<p>Herr Zangler &#x2014;</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Marie</hi></speaker><lb/>
<stage>(Weinberl zu Fu&#x0364;ßen fallend).</stage><lb/>
<p>Lieber Herr Onkel-Vormund &#x017F;ein Sie nicht<lb/>
