in Sonders Arme).</stage></sp><lb/>
<spGrp><stage rendition="#rightBraced">(Zugleich.)</stage><sp who="#MAR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Marie</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Augu&#x017F;t!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#SON"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Sonders</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Marie!</p></sp></spGrp><lb/>
<sp who="#WEIN"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Weinberl</hi></speaker><lb/>
